        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a multi-file Python integration project with specific requirements for each file. The project involves integrating with a hosted LLM service, specifically AWS, for various text processing tasks. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. The local helper files can contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities. </thinking>\n\n",
